<!DOCTYPE html>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../themes/darkTheme/sidebar.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../themes/darkTheme/theme.css">
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Watch Laro - Trouble Shooting</title>

</head>

<body>
    <%- include('header.ejs') %>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="w-full justify-items-left p-10">
                <h1 class="font-black text-3xl">Common Problems</h1>
                <div class="w-full p-5">
                    <ul>
                        <li>
                             <h2 class="font-bold text-xl">The movie/tv has no audio</h2>
                             <p>You can fix it by using a supported browser such as Edge, Safari. (or any other browser that supports Dolby Audio Playback.) Or you can instead <a href="/install" class="text-blue-500 underline">install</a> our app which should fix the problem.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                             <h2 class="font-bold text-xl">The movie/tv doesn't play</h2>
                             <p>You either have slow internet or there is no available torrents for it.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                             <h2 class="font-bold text-xl">After pausing it takes a long time to resume</h2>
                             <p>You could have paused for a long time, and our system doesnt like idling users to save space we had to remove it after 3 mins of idling.</p>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                   
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

</body>

</html>